{"id":"174d75d13166bebf","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite.md","title":"有界创建层级排除无限归约","display":"thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite — 有界创建层级排除无限归约","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite","aliases":["56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite"],"display":"thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite — 有界创建层级排除无限归约","depends_on":["[[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]]","[[56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo]]"],"source_section":"§8.4.4 Theorem 8.4.41","source_printed_pages":"354","source_ocr_blocks":[375],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite — 有界创建层级排除无限归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8fede32032ab9e5\" href=\"?note=b8fede32032ab9e5\" title=\"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction\">56-df-hw-bounded-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a80c063491021827\" href=\"?note=a80c063491021827\" title=\"56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo\">56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4.4 Theorem 8.4.41"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"354"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>375</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b8fede32032ab9e5\" href=\"?note=b8fede32032ab9e5\" title=\"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction\">56-df-hw-bounded-reduction</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm H},R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R\">\\(T^{\\mathrm H},R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(N\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；约化序及其截断参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a80c063491021827\" href=\"?note=a80c063491021827\" title=\"56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo\">56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}\">\\(\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}\\)</span> 为该规则子集在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm H}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm H}\\)</span> 上的通常一步关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 沿归约方向排除无限链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{WF}(T^{\\mathrm H},\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{WF}(T^{\\mathrm H},\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol{\\hat s}\\in(T^{\\mathrm H})^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R(\\boldsymbol{\\hat s},\\boldsymbol v,N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol{\\hat s}\\in(T^{\\mathrm H})^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R(\\boldsymbol{\\hat s},\\boldsymbol v,N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反设有规则左模式高度≤N的无限链。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\max(\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\hat s_0),N+1)\">\\(H=\\max(\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\hat s_0),N+1)\\)</span>。每次收缩只保留、复制或删去上下文/变量实例的旧符号，并创建层级≤N+1的新函数符号。逐步归纳可知链中每项属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\)</span>。上游引理将每步在这个域上定向为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;_H\">\\(&gt;_H\\)</span> 严格下降，违反其良基性。这同时排除无具体步记录的一步关系无限链；在ZFC中对每条关系边选择规则/位置/替换见证也可还原具体路径。第二式是第一式用于已带具体步的有界归约。</p>\n<p>该证明的界H依赖有限初项，允许初项中有层级&gt;N的不可收缩部分。固定N仅限制被收缩左模式，不暗中把这类初项排除。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.4.41，原书证明已读并通过有界签名接口展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"b8fede32032ab9e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo","status":"resolved","id":"a80c063491021827","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"b8fede32032ab9e5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]] 的 $T^{\\mathrm H},R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R$。$N\\in\\mathbb N$；约化序及其截断参数见 [[56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo]]。$\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}$ 为该规则子集在整个 $T^{\\mathrm H}$ 上的通常一步关系；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 沿归约方向排除无限链。","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo","status":"resolved","id":"a80c063491021827","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]] 的 $T^{\\mathrm H},R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R$。$N\\in\\mathbb N$；约化序及其截断参数见 [[56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo]]。$\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}$ 为该规则子集在整个 $T^{\\mathrm H}$ 上的通常一步关系；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 沿归约方向排除无限链。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm H},R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{WF}(T^{\\mathrm H},\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol{\\hat s}\\in(T^{\\mathrm H})^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_{R^{\\mathrm H}_R}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R(\\boldsymbol{\\hat s},\\boldsymbol v,N).","display":true},{"tex":"H=\\max(\\operatorname{ht}_{\\mathrm H}(\\hat s_0),N+1)","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}","display":false},{"tex":">_H","display":false}],"bytes":2192,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite.md]]"},{"id":"59b32ea2cec82a1a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-family-development]] 的 $\\mathcal M_R,T_R^L,\\operatorname{InfFamDev}_R$，基础TRS左线性。$\\Pi_R,\\operatorname{HRed}_R$ 及HW提升接口见 [[56-lem-levy-hw-projection]]；HW有界归约的终止性见 [[56-thm-hw-bounded-reductions-finite]]。"}],"outgoing":["b8fede32032ab9e5","a80c063491021827"]}